<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan starts Steel Dynamics.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan starts Steel Dynamics.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said Tuesday it initiated coverage of Steel Dynamics Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Steel Dynamics gained 3/8 to 17-7/8 in early morning trading.</p>
</text>
